    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Group Visits and Tours"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Underwater Observatory is an unique attraction that combines fun and learning in a once in a lifetime experience.",
      "html": "The Underwater Observatory is an unique attraction that combines fun and learning in a once in a lifetime experience."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Our venue is ideal for organized groups.",
      "html": "Our venue is ideal for organized groups."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We are very experienced in providing a truly tailor-made experience and catering to the unique needs of your group.",
      "html": "We are very experienced in providing a truly tailor-made experience and catering to the unique needs of your group."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We offer a range of made-to-fit group activities, private guided tours of a range of displays for varying age groups (at an additional fee).",
      "html": "We offer a range of made-to-fit group activities, private guided tours of a range of displays for varying age groups (at an additional fee)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We can also add a branded sign with the name of group displayed by a diver in the Shark Pool.",
      "html": "We can also add a branded sign with the name of group displayed by a diver in the Shark Pool."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Special prices are available for groups | Groups can be combined.",
      "html": "Special prices are available for groups | Groups can be combined."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "* Minimum 20 participants",
      "html": "* Minimum 20 participants"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Fixed fee for entrance",
      "html": "Fixed fee for entrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Extras have an additional cost",
      "html": "Extras have an additional cost"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For details and reservations please contact Larissa Katz, Group Sales and Operations Manager, 08-6364202, larisa@coralworld.com",
      "html": "For details and reservations please contact Larissa Katz, Group Sales and Operations Manager, 08-6364202, larisa@coralworld.com"
    }
  ],
